  "body": "Refs #70. Draft for Owner independent acceptance. Current V3 full gates are running; do not merge.\n\nImplements a separate TEST_ONLY SQL namespace and local fixture port over unchanged accepted ReviewTarget/original BYTEA. Per-claim dispositions and all section acknowledgments commit atomically with first-writer CAS, version high-water, canonical-command idempotency, private audit and undelivered outbox. DB SESSION_USER/current tenant/report assignments/policy/original bytes convey fixture authority. Frozen native validate_proposal executes inside the transaction; deferred SQL validates current authority/expiry before commit. Production/native approval/share ports remain DENY.\n\nCurrent functional V3 source: `8e99cb522a5c80faa3696a828fb199d4635e6407`. Latest accepted main: `558d183624a0a36d1f4eaf9d3d75af73b9c88547`. New schema/migration only; original 0001/0002, reviewing/reporting/Guard/evidence/accepted QA/Gold, four old CI/Docker, operator console and Codex-2 files are unchanged. Exactly three authorized infrastructure files have minimal existing-file changes.\n\nSelf-review caught a real raw-SQL/native whitespace validation discrepancy: reason `\"\\u00a0\"` was rejected by native/Python but raw SQL committed a SIMULATED event. No native approval or share occurred. Prior candidate `292b030593c60e64c6f4e5f0a1473b113836e554` is withdrawn as final despite its original 98-case PASS/six SUCCESS. Actual pre-fix 11 PASS / 1 FAIL, JUnit, SQL/test snapshots and durable test receipt are retained in `unicode-pre-fix/`. The fix matches the native complete whitespace repertoire, preserving original C0/bidi/size restrictions, and compares JSON hash pins without coercion. No accepted native oracle changed.\n\nFrozen V3: all original 98 V2 assertions/source retained unchanged + 33 new real-PG parity cases = 131, no skip/xfail. New cases cover 29 whitespace blanks, legitimate Unicode-padded text and numeric JSON hash-pin negatives. Actual repair smoke: 33/33 PASS. `FROZEN_MATRIX_V3.json`, `MATRIX_V2_TO_V3_CHAIN.json`, `MIGRATION3_NATIVE_PARITY.diff` and `UNICODE_NATIVE_PARITY_REPAIR.md` preserve the stronger matrix/diff. Fresh complete Python3.11/3.13 P1 54 + v2 compatibility54 + P2A86 + pure35 + P2B1 131 now run on separate isolated clusters/worktrees at the exact V3 source SHA, with six hosted CI in parallel.\n\nAll prior V1/V2 RED/GREEN and local binary/source evidence remain intact. Final V3 exact HEAD, full dual-runtime JUnit/raw archive, six new hosted SUCCESS links, ordered merge parents, actual checkout logs/security artifacts and remaining risks will be posted after execution. No FINAL PASS claim yet.\n\nBoundary: TEST_ONLY_SYNTHETIC_DECISIONS_NOT_HUMAN_APPROVAL. No real human identity/signature, native ReviewDecision, APPROVED ReportVersion, ShareGrant, customer access, external sender, model, payment or deployment. Human Gold 0/26; RA4 EXIT/RA5 live NO-GO. Keep Draft for exact-SHA RA4A_P2B1_FINAL_PASS.",
